From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:19:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] oledlg: the OLE UI dialogs (3227)

Implements the 18 stubs: OleUIConvert, OleUIChangeIcon, OleUIBusy,
OleUIPromptUser, OleUIEditLinks, OleUIUpdateLinks, OleUIChangeSource,
OleUIObjectProperties (A and W), OleUIInsertObjectW and
OleUICanConvertOrActivateAs, with the dialog templates, the icon box
control, the standard field validation and hook functions, and the
resource and error ids the OLE UI headers define.

